0	section	Starting off
1	line	Cassius	You!
1	line	Player	Me?
1	line	Cassius	Yes you!
1	line	Player	Can I... help you?
1	line	Cassius	That depends. Do you like making money?
1	line	Player	I'm not averse to making money.
1	line	Cassius	And do you enjoy... milk?
1	line	Player	Milk?
1	line	Cassius	Milk.
1	cond	If the player is on a quest speedrunning world:
2	line	Player	I suppose it's okay.
2	line	Cassius	Well, fair enough. If your passion for milk changes, let me know.
2	box	This quest is not available on Speedrunning Worlds.
1	line	Player	I can't say I've thought much about it.
1	line	Cassius	Would you like to think more about it?
1	box	Before starting this quest, be aware that your combat level is lower than the recommended level of 15.
1	select	Start The Ides of Milk quest?
1	option	Yes.
2	line	Player	What am I going to get from thinking more about... milk?
2	line	Cassius	Profit!
2	line	Cassius	Ten to fifteen percent, performance depending.
2	line	Player	How are we going to be making that profit? And who even are you anyway?
2	line	Cassius	Ah, my name is Cassius. I got carried away.
2	line	Cassius	But, we're going to construct an empire.
2	line	Player	Of milk?
2	line	Cassius	Of milk.
2	line	Player	How do you intend to make an empire of milk?
2	line	Cassius	So, the first step is going to involve you doing a little... research.
2	line	Player	Right...
2	line	Cassius	You're going to cross the River Lum, find Gillie and Seth Groats, and learn about animal husbandry.
2	line	Cassius	Then... Then you're going to cross back to this side of the river, and tell me all about how they've made their animals so productive.
2	line	Cassius	It's a perfect plan!
2	line	Player	What use is it if I know everything and you don't? Couldn't I make my own... milk empire... with that information?
2	line	Player	If anything I should be cutting you in at ten to fifteen percent.
2	line	Cassius	Hey, I'm the one supplying the high-quality milk here.
2	line	Cassius	Not to mention, my associate Brutus is already embedded in the Groats operation to work a different angle. That will prove most lucrative.
2	line	Player	Right... I guess I'll go and see the Groatses then.
2	action	end
1	option	No.
2	line	Player	No, I'm not sure I would like that, thank you.
2	action	end
