0	section	Returning to Cassius
1	line	Cassius	So, how did you get on?
1	line	Player	I've learned a lot about how the Groats family care for their animals. They say the secret is happiness!
1	line	Cassius	Happiness?! That can't be the only trick they use! Surely you found something else?
2	line	Player	Now that you mention it, Seth did say he had a book that I... don't have on me right now.
2	line	Cassius	The legendary Groats book on milk cultivation? I'm most interested! Go fetch it!
2	action	end
1	line	Player	I have this book from Seth. He claims it's got his principles of animal husbandry in it, if that's of any use?
1	line	Cassius	Hand it here, quickly!
1	box	Cassius snatches the book from your hands.
1	line	Cassius	Now, this is most curious.
1	line	Cassius	The idea that a happy animal will do what you want is frankly absurd. What if they choose to not produce. Are you supposed to respect that?
1	line	Cassius	However, the writings on the systems of taxation are fascinating. I couldn't imagine Seth was smart enough to put this together.
1	line	Player	So, do you think this is enough to start our milk empire?
1	line	Cassius	No, no. Not quite yet. First of all, you haven't tried our milk yet, have you?
1	line	Player	I don't think I have, no. You already have some milk?
1	line	Cassius	Don't look so worried. Here, have a try.
1	box	Cassius hands you a milk sample to try.
1	action	end
