0	section	After sampling the milk
1	line	Player	Oh, that's not good milk.
1	action	The player coughs and is damaged for 1 Hitpoints with a poison hitsplat.
1	line	Player	That's really not good milk.
1	line	Cassius	So, what do you think? The milk is fantastic, isn't it?
1	line	Player	It wasn't what I was expecting, certainly.
1	line	Cassius	We're going to change the lactic landscape! Before we do though, I have another task for you.
1	line	Player	Now what do you need?
1	line	Cassius	We need... a permit.
1	line	Player	Shouldn't you have got a permit before making milk?
1	line	Cassius	The permit is to sell milk, not to make milk!
1	line	Player	Fine, where are we going to get this permit?
1	line	Cassius	From the Duke of Lumbridge! Where else? You need to bring him our milk and I'm sure he'll give us our permit without fuss.
1	line	Player	Are you sure having the Duke drink our milk is a good idea?
1	line	Cassius	Of course! Soon the whole of Lumbridge will be drinking my, I mean our milk!
1	box	Cassius hands you a milk sample.
1	action	end
