0	section	Talking to the Duke
1	line	Duke Horacio	Greetings. Welcome to my castle.
1	line	Player	Greetings. I come seeking a business permit.
1	line	Duke Horacio	Oh wonderful! What sort of business are you looking to start?
1	line	Player	I'm looking to get into the milk trade!
1	line	Duke Horacio	Milk? Well, the Groats family still have their permit, and I can't start stepping on their toes.
1	line	Player	If you'd just try this milk...
1	line	Duke Horacio	I really couldn't possibly give you a permit without their approval. This is really their territory.
1	line	Duke Horacio	Why not speak to Gillie Groats? She seems to handle the milk side of the business now. Maybe she'll get you set up under their permit.
1	line	Player	You're the Duke. Couldn't you just grant a permit?
1	line	Duke Horacio	No, no. It's really quite important you speak to Gillie about this.
1	line	Player	Aren't you the highest power in this land?
1	line	Duke Horacio	Don't go digging too deeply into that. Even I have some... commitments that I have to keep to.
1	line	Player	But you're the Duke, you shouldn't need the approval of a business entity to grant a permit.
1	line	Player	Not to mention, can't they just refuse to have any competitors?
1	line	Duke Horacio	Well absolutely, but I'm sure you'll find they're more than reasonable about things.
1	line	Duke Horacio	Entirely. Completely reasonable.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to the Duke again
1	line	Duke Horacio	Greetings. Welcome to my castle.
1	line	Player	Hi, what did you want me to do for the permit again?
1	line	Duke Horacio	Go speak to Gillie Groats. She seems to handle the milk business in Lumbridge. Maybe she'll get you set up under their permit.
1	line	Player	Thanks.
1	action	end
0	section	Talking to Gillie
1	line	Gillie Groats	Hiya, did you need something else from me?
1	line	Player	I did. I've been trying to secure a business permit from the Duke, but he said that as it is a milk-related business venture, I should speak to you instead.
1	line	Gillie Groats	The Duke is a good man, directing you to me! I've been running the milk side of our farm for a while now.
1	line	Gillie Groats	Were you thinking of being a competitor to us then?
2	line	Player	I can prove we wouldn't be if you could just try this sample of...
2	line	Gillie Groats	Sample of?
2	line	Player	I seem to have misplaced my sample of milk. I'll be back when I have it.
2	action	end
2	line	Player	I think if you were to try this sample here you'd see we wouldn't be competing.
2	line	Gillie Groats	You want me to drink a vial of mysterious liquid?
2	line	Player	Well, it's not mysterious, it's milk!
2	line	Gillie Groats	No, I think you should drink it, I'll know the quality of it from your reaction.
2	line	Gillie Groats	It is just milk after all.
2	line	Player	Would it convince you to help me with my permit?
2	line	Gillie Groats	It definitely won't hurt your chances.
2	action	end
